    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n10042" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀντικοντόω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>support with a pole</i> or <i>stick,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ξύλῳ ἀ. τῷ σώματι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hp.
					<u>Mochl.</u>
					20
				</span></i>
			 (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀντικονταίνουσι</span> prob.l.
			for 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-κοταίνουσι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Erot.
				</span></i>
			, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-κοτέουσι</span> or <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-κοντέουσι</span> codd.).—But
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-όω</span> is confirmed by <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀντικόντωσις</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εως</span>, ἡ, <i>the
				support of a stick</i> to a lame man, <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				<u>Art.</u>
				52
			</span></i>,<i><span class="en">
				58
			</span></i>.</div>
